        break;

    case 'onfiles':  // onfiles ROOT PDD PRE SUB — AC-ON1's two files, put where the INSTALLED tool's --check agent-cc reads them: SUB is
                     // qf_on's copy and the tool's data folder (qf_tool's DN_DATA_DIR, cliDataDir), and QuoteAgentCopy::check reads both
                     // there. quote_mail.log: onlog's copy in PRE, taken before the book, copied whole and its dated "sent" lines counted
                     // again in SUB through ROOT's (the installed) QuoteAgentCopy::mailLines. email_settings.json: the live file cut to
                     // mailSetting()'s keys ($MS; never the mailbox password), by conf's cut; a live file that cannot be read makes no
                     // copy (es=unreadable). The control on the second: preconditions(), rule 2's one line, the same on SUB as on the
                     // live data folder. Neither file may be in SUB before (qf_copy makes neither). The live side is only read.
        [$root, $pdd, $pre, $sub] = $a;
